					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cum tuis literis scriptis 27. huius mensis, que restabant folia, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>recepi et legi omnia magna cum voluptate.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nomen <persName ref="p18090">regis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>Navarre</persName> nunc non occurrit; sed satis erit, si inscripte sint <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>regi Navarre; nullus enim honorabilior titulus.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Per fratrem <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>curabo, ut fiat, quod visum tibi erit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Tuas puto illi literas fore <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>gratissimas et fructum allaturas; rempublicam praeterea eo officio tibi <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>devincies.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">D. <persName>Redonensis</persName> episcopus lubentissime leget.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Is <placeName ref="l546">Vienna</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>scribit ad me 8. huius mensis pontificem duas misisse bullas, unam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>indulgentiarum aut iubilei, quam puto te vidisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">In altera, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quia principes novam postulabant indictionem, non continuationem, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>iis verbis usus est: "Indicimus sublata omni suspensione."</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Ipse existimat neque esse, quare de nova indictione <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tantopere contendamus, neque quare illi recusarent.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Putat <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>imperator, quod stabit per illa verba "sublata omni suspensione", <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quominus consentiant <placeName ref="l822">Germani</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ex tribus pontificis internunciis, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>qui tum ibi erant, duo constituebant ire per totam <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ut intimarent consilium omnibus principibus confessionis <placeName>Augustane</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>et aliis.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Noluit ferre imperator, ut prima bulla <placeName ref="l546">Vien<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ne</placeName>, quod nimis expressa fuit mentio continuationis in ea.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Metuunt a <placeName>Vayvoda</placeName> et <placeName ref="l869">Transsilvania</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dux <persName>Mantuanus</persName> ducturus <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>filiam est imperatoris.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Scripsit rex <placeName ref="l167">Genevensibus</placeName>, ne permittant, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ut concionatores tumultus moveant in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName>, sed revocent, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>qui seditiones suscitare cogitarent.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Regine misi, que <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>semel ad me scripseras ea de re.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Petunt status amnistiam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Sunt, qui petant templa, ubi pure concionetur et administrentur <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>sacramenta et adsint officiarii principes, quo certius cognoscant, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>quam pacem optent, qui evangelici vocantur, et abhorreant a tumultibus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Expecto, quid de ea re actum erit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">In bona spe sunt pii omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Salutabis amplissimum senatum et amicos omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Tuus ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Von anderer Hand:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Henrico Bulinghero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> pastori <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vigilantissimo.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
